f.2020","TDY.capex.2020"]},{"topic":"returns","text":"In FY2025 the company paid $403 million to repurchase its own shares. No dividend payment is tagged for the year.","cites":["TDY.buybacks.2025"]},{"topic":"quarter","text":"In the three months ended 2026-09-27 revenue was $1.7 billion, up 9.4% from $1.5 billion in the three months ended 2025-09-28.","cites":["TDY.d.revenue.2026-06-29.2026-09-27","TDY.d.revenue.2025-06-30.2025-09-28"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Over the four quarters to 2026-09-27 revenue added up to $6.5 billion (computed from five filed figures), operating income to $1.3 billion and net income to $1 billion.","cites":["TDY.d.revenue.2024-12-30.2025-12-28","TDY.d.revenue.2024-12-30.2025-09-28","TDY.d.revenue.2025-12-29.2026-03-29","TDY.d.revenue.2026-03-30.2026-06-28","TDY.d.revenue.2026-06-29.2026-09-27","TDY.d.opinc.2024-12-30.2025-12-28","TDY.d.opinc.2024-12-30.2025-09-28","TDY.d.opinc.2025-12-29.2026-03-29","TDY.d.opinc.2026-03-30.2026-06-28","TDY.d.opinc.2026-06-29.2026-09-27","TDY.d.netinc.2024-12-30.2025-12-28","TDY.d.netinc.2024-12-30.2025-09-28","TDY.d.netinc.2025-12-29.2026-03-29","TDY.d.netinc.2026-03-30.2026-06-28","TDY.d.netinc.2026-06-29.2026-09-27"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Free cash flow over the same four quarters was $1.1 billion: operating cash flow of $1.3 billion less capital spending of $133 million (computed from ten filed figures).","cites":["TDY.d.ocf.2024-12-30.2025-12-28","TDY.d.ocf.2024-12-30.2025-09-28","TDY.d.ocf.2025-12-29.2026-03-29","TDY.d.ocf.2025-12-29.2026-06-28","TDY.d.ocf.2025-12-29.2026-09-27","TDY.d.capex.2024-12-30.2025-12-28","TDY.d.capex.2024-12-30.2025-09-28","TDY.d.capex.2025-12-29.2026-03-29","TDY.d.capex.2025-12-29.2026-06-28","TDY.d.capex.2025-12-29.2026-09-27"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"For the other named executive officers the same table gives an average of $4.2 million in total and $2.8 million actually paid.","cites":["TDY.pay.neoTotal.2025","TDY.pay.neoPaid.2025"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"The table puts the value of $100 held in the company’s shares over the years it covers at $132.00 at the end of FY2025, and $193.00 for the peer group the company chose.","cites":["TDY.pay.tsr.2025","TDY.pay.peerTsr.2025"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Remaining performance obligations - revenue under contract that was not yet recognised - were $4.6 billion at the end of FY2025, against $3.7 billion a year earlier. That is 75.4% of FY2025 revenue (computed from two filed figures).","cites":["TDY.rpo.2025","TDY.rpo.2024","TDY.revenue.2025"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Deferred revenue was $370 million at the end of FY2025 (tagged ContractWithCustomerLiabilityCurrent), against $313 million a year earlier.","cites":["TDY.deferred.2025","TDY.deferred.2024"]},{"topic":"people","text":"The latest annual report gives the workforce as 15,800 in its own words. FY2025 revenue works out to about $387,000 for each (computed from one filed figure and the number in that sentence).","cites":["TDY.q.employees","TDY.revenue.2025"]},{"topic":"flags","text":"The FY2025 annual report tags restructuring charges of $18.6 million, after $15.6 million in FY2024.","cites":["TDY.restructuring.2025","TDY.restructuring.2024"]},{"topic":"debt","text":"At the end of FY2025 the balance sheet carried $352 million in cash and cash equivalents, and $2.5 billion of debt as tagged (LongTermDebtNoncurrent + LongTermDebtCurrent). Debt less cash was $2.1 billion (computed from three filed figures).","cites":["TDY.cash.2025","TDY.debtLong.2025","TDY.debtCurrent.2025"]}]},"fin":{"TDY":{"insiders":{"from":"2025-11-23","to":"2026-11-23","complete":true,"listed":31,"read":31,"other":0,"failed":0,"odd":0,"people":[["Belak Cynthia Y","Senior VP and Controller"],["VON SCHACK WESLEY W","Director"],["LORNE SIMON M","Director"],["VanWees Jason","Vice Chairman"],["SMITH MICHAEL T","Director"]],"rows":[["S",0,4528,2976952.58,"2026-11-11","2026-11-11","0001641318-26-000009","2026-11-12",0],["S",1,468,321342.84,"2026-08-12","2026-0